  "scope_notes": "Touches only deterministic Guix build scripts, package manifests, and the lint dependency requirement for lief.",
  "changed_since_previous": "Rebased following the merge of related cleanups (#35869, #35870), with the core time-machine bump and CMake 4 adaptations unchanged.",
  "card": "Updates the Guix time-machine pinned commit to a newer upstream revision and updates package definitions across deterministic build manifests. It switches to CMake 4.3.3 with CMAKE_LINK_WARNING_AS_ERROR, reverts osslsigncode to upstream Guix, bumps lief to 1.0.0, and disables fixincludes on cross-gcc. This keeps release builds reproducible on modern toolchains and makes GCC 16 and Clang 22/23 available for Guix builds.",
